msgstr "✂️ The video was longer than %(seconds)s seconds, so only the first %(seconds)s seconds were used."

msgid "🎥 /round — turn a video into a round video (Telegram Video Note)\n\nHow does it work?\n\n1) Convert a new video\n• First type /round\n• Then send the video\n✅ The bot turns the video into a round one and sends it back.\n\n2) Convert a video already in the chat\n• Reply to any video in the chat with the bot\n• Type /round in the reply\n✅ The bot turns that video into a round one and sends it back.\n\nNote:\n• Works only with video files.\n• Very large or very long videos may be cut or rejected.\n\n⏳ Now send the video you want to make round:"
msgstr "🎥 /round — turn a video into a round video (Telegram Video Note)\n\nHow does it work?\n\n1) Convert a new video\n• First type /round\n• Then send the video\n✅ The bot turns the video into a round one and sends it back.\n\n2) Convert a video already in the chat\n• Reply to any video in the chat with the bot\n• Type /round in the reply\n✅ The bot turns that video into a round one and sends it back.\n\nNote:\n• Works only with video files.\n• Very large or very long videos may be cut or rejected.\n\n⏳ Now send the video you want to make round:"

